== Finite mathematical boundary

Both modes independently pass the source-bound finite checker. All 540 mapped
decoded owner pairs are token-identical under one complete identical attribute/
tag definition per symbol; no new nonliteral relation or mapping is introduced.
Every distinct mapped decoded expression and port text (168 per mode) undergoes
native parse/render faithfulness under both locked kernels, including literal
units/projectors. The exact additive formal witness avoids the old helper's
unit-power negative limitation by cancellation, not parameter evaluation.
All sums remain whole. Neither whole-graph expansion/distribution, Dirac trace
nor numerical/parameter-at-one proof is used.

The aggregate is independently checked as numerator prefactor times every local
vertex and edge factor for all 30 graphs in each producer, in both kernels and
fresh side-order processes. Projector is separately bound, not accidentally
multiplied into that aggregate. The precise conclusion is #emph[Symbolica-
normalized equality under identical attribute-bearing definitions], plus named
repeat-free axis multiset transport. The live per-owner ports and 56 nontrivial
cross-route permutations are retained, with current interfaces on 56 local
owners (32 vertices and 24 edges). Historical payloads have no native interface
fields. Within-route anchor guards additionally bind actual interface presence,
interface values and typed port #emph[order] exactly; these are capture-integrity
facts distinct from derived named-axis mathematics.

Only exercised whole-symbol spelling maps are used; counts are derived in the
receipt. Declared but unexercised maps are not evidence. Tagged historical
`Q` and `edge` are the only exercised maps here (480 and 960 token occurrences
respectively across both modes' decoded expressions and ports). Vertex, K and P
maps are absent in this case. Historical
spellings are audited from source definitions and uses, not natively proved
equivalent before mapping. Historical reversible cook decoding is the actual
producer's observed association, not a universal uncook proof. Ports versus
expression free indices, local factor placement/locality and downstream
positional consumers remain source-qualified/capture-bound. The observer is
joined to the assertion ELF through complete payloads; it is not instrumentation
of that assertion process's in-memory owners.

== Predicate-isolating controls and limits

The new bounded suite mutates fresh consumed inputs and, for mathematical
controls, corresponding anchors consistently. It retains the exact intended
and observed stage, real subprocess argv/exit, inputs/ELFs before and after,
emitted native pairs and results. Setup/body exceptions cannot count as a
semantic rejection. Owner missing/extra/duplicate/swap, physical rule/particle/
incidence/routing/cut drift, group/source/factor correspondence, definitions
including attribute/tag subsets and internal conflicts, live/interface links,
schema/tuple/type/mode, coefficient/sign/power, fully mirrored aggregate and
malformed syntax are exercised. Positive whole-key reorders and valid named
port transposes call the real checked paths. Capture-interface and anchor-only
controls are separately identified; baseline anchors are self-comparisons with
no additional algebra credit.

